# Detection Logic

Preferred Sysmon detection:

```spl
index=* EventCode=1
(CommandLine="*-EncodedCommand*" OR CommandLine="* -enc *")
```

Portfolio-formatted output:

```spl
index=* EventCode=1
(CommandLine="*-EncodedCommand*" OR CommandLine="* -enc *")
| eval detection="DET-003 - Encoded PowerShell Execution"
| table _time detection host User Image CommandLine
```

Raw-event fallback:

```spl
index=* ("-EncodedCommand" OR " -enc ")
```

The Sysmon version is preferred because it specifically evaluates process-creation command-line telemetry.

