# Controlled Validation Activity

A benign PowerShell payload was created:

```powershell
$cmd='Write-Output "DET003 Positive Validation"'
```

The command was converted into Base64 using PowerShell's expected Unicode encoding:

```powershell
$encoded=[Convert]::ToBase64String([Text.Encoding]::Unicode.GetBytes($cmd))
```

It was then executed using:

```powershell
powershell.exe -EncodedCommand $encoded
```

The command only produced:

```text
DET003 Positive Validation
```

No malicious action was performed.

The purpose was to safely generate telemetry containing the execution characteristic targeted by DET-003.

