# Negative Validation

Normal PowerShell commands were executed without encoded-command arguments.

Examples:

```powershell
Get-Date
```

```powershell
Get-ComputerInfo | Select-Object WindowsProductName
```

DET-003 did not identify the normal execution during the isolated negative-test window.

Result:

```text
DET-003 NOT TRIGGERED
```

**Negative Test:** PASS

