---

# Detection Limitations

DET-003 currently:

- Focuses primarily on encoded-command arguments
- Does not automatically decode payloads
- Does not independently establish malicious intent
- Does not detect every form of PowerShell abuse
- Relies on endpoint telemetry visibility
- May identify legitimate administrative activity
- Requires analyst correlation for higher-confidence conclusions

These limitations are intentional for the current stage of the lab and provide opportunities for future detection engineering.

